 CellMargins -> {{60, 60}, {2, 14}}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"7285fa0f-2cb8-4fc2-bc9c-d738cc5f611b"],

Cell["\<\
The figure below is the latest IRI / CPC forecast plume, the canonical \
visualisation of the operational ENSO outlook. Each line is one dynamical or \
statistical model; the spread of the cloud is what forecasters call the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]plume\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"61b1fc6e-d147-4dc1-812d-718e8f8b2e72"],

