Cell["\<\
Top: IRI / CPC plume (latest issue). Middle: toy-model ensemble cone from the \
recharge\[Dash]discharge oscillator implemented in this notebook, initialised \
from the same observed state. Bottom: NOAA CPC official 3-class probability \
bars for the next nine rolling 3-month seasons.\
\>", "Caption",
 FontFamily->
  "Helvetica",ExpressionUUID->"c45cef12-ae08-4b77-aa09-1a63aae101e8"],

