Cell["\<\
Observed Ni\[NTilde]o 3.4 autocorrelation \[Rho](m\:2080, lead) since 1950. \
Whatever the start month, forecasts whose verification time crosses April\
\[Dash]June collapse to near-zero skill. The right-hand column (Aug\[Dash]Oct \
starts) keeps high \[Rho] all the way into next year's DJF event peak.\
\>", "Caption",
 FontFamily->
  "Helvetica",ExpressionUUID->"a01f2497-18bd-4157-a03a-dcea86f27046"],

