Cell["\<\
Phase-space portrait (T vs h). The cycle is counter-clockwise \[LongDash] \
anomalous warming charges the thermocline; the thermocline then discharges \
back to neutral over ~4 years.\
\>", "Caption",
 FontFamily->
  "Helvetica",ExpressionUUID->"f0d55b5b-c943-46f1-9a16-cf16f1e70640"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FontSlant -> Italic], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"41966099-1534-4a1b-a9f6-0fcf94ab0204"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FontSize -> 11], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"4c477023-d53c-4c64-bc3f-5330390e25d8"],

Cell["Caption", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"717104c0-7ce3-4d6b-b132-930db1fe0c1c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 CellMargins -> {{60, 60}, {2, 14}}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"f7612c14-f1f0-4660-b725-07c62554cf13"],

Cell["\<\
Now we initialise 500-member ensembles in four different calendar months. The \
same model, the same parameters, the same random-number machinery \[LongDash] \
only the initial calendar phase differs. The cone of uncertainty breathes \
with the seasonal cycle:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1c8fa869-efb9-41b2-be76-d224a0f6711d"],

