Cell["\<\
Ensemble forecast cones from the recharge\[Dash]discharge oscillator, 500 \
members each, initialised in Jan / Apr / Jul / Oct respectively. The cone \
widens fastest when the verification window crosses the spring barrier.\
\>", "Caption",
 FontFamily->
  "Helvetica",ExpressionUUID->"12cb0fb4-0100-41f9-a269-6aaec3727f09"],

